      "Contested order · Conflict": "争持中的秩序 · 冲突",
      "CHIEF AS HUB": "首长即中心",
      "CHAIN + COMMAND": "流程链＋命令链",
      "AUTONOMOUS PROFESSIONALS": "自主的专业人员",
