  ,"The business-model bridge is informed by Alexander Osterwalder and Yves Pigneur, Business Model Generation (Wiley, 2010).": "La sección Puente se inspira en Alexander Osterwalder e Yves Pigneur, Business Model Generation (Wiley, 2010)."
